      "description": "Microsoft's August 2025 quantum-safe security blog describes hybrid PQC (ECDHE + ML-KEM/Kyber) rolling out across Azure infrastructure including Front Door TLS connections and Azure Storage endpoints. No public statement confirms Entra ID's specific authentication endpoints (login.microsoftonline.com) have hybrid PQC enabled today - the evidence is at the broader Azure platform level.",
